 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="A Dry White Season" href="/whats-on/a-dry-white-season" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>A Dry White Season</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>An ordinary man’s conscience is ignited as apartheid’s violence shatters his complacency, in this searing drama about moral courage and the cost of looking away.</p>
  </div>
