 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Ace in the Hole" href="/whats-on/ace-in-the-hole" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Ace in the Hole</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>A journalist commits to never letting the truth, professional ethics or morality, get in the way of a good story in Billy Wilder’s tightly-scripted masterpiece.</p>
  </div>
