 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="American Doctor" href="/whats-on/american-doctor" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>American Doctor<span data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf> - Preview</span></a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Three American doctors enter Gaza to save lives, but what they witness compels them to carry their fight from the operating theatre to Washington.</p>
  </div>
