 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Animal Farm" href="/whats-on/animal-farm" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Animal Farm</a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>John Halas’s groundbreaking animated feature, an adaptation of George Orwell’s chilling political parable, has been restored to all its dazzling glory.</p>
