 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Belle" href="/whats-on/belle" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Belle</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Featuring a breakthrough performance by Gugu Mbatha-Raw, Amma Assante’s Belle is an antidote to race-blind English period dramas.</p>
