 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Billy in Berlin: The Man in Search of His Murderer" href="/whats-on/billy-in-berlin-the-man-in-search-of-his-murderer" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Billy in Berlin: The Man in Search of His Murderer</a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>A rarely screened early gem, written by Billy Wilder, is accompanied by a discussion of the German émigrés who were to indelibly change Hollywood cinema.</p>
  </div>
